      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUSTLIKEDAVE (7) again drew a wide gate last start but was game in defeat, beaten 5.5 metres into second at Melton over 1720m. Will need a bit of luck again negotiating a very wide starting position. Steps up a level but he is good enough to make his presence felt. ALTA BAYAMO (9) was out of the money two runs ago then broke and finished sixth last start over 1690m at Shepparton, coming home 25 metres from the winner. Only needs to get things right to be in contention. BONA KHAN (8) is on the radar after his last-start fifth over 2080m at this track three weeks ago. GIDGETT KAY (1) broke in the run and finished a long last when resuming last start over 1609m at this track. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Won't find this any harder and she can bounce back.",
